{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Welcome to Sproutmart!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sproutmart</i> is a relaxing, cozy shop management simulation where you build, customize, and run your very own grocery store. Grow fresh produce in your backyard farm, decorate every corner of your shop, and serve your customers with love \u2014 all at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Build &amp; expand your grocery shop</strong> \u2013 Design layouts, upgrade shelves, and stock up on homegrown goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3d <strong>Backyard farming</strong> \u2013 Plant, grow, and harvest fruits and vegetables right behind your shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize your space</strong> \u2013 Decorate with style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Multiplayer co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends online to grow, manage, and decorate your store together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing</strong> \u2013 Catch fish and add fresh seafood to your product lineup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Sell what you grow</strong> \u2013 Harvest your crops, fill your displays, and keep your customers happy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2601\ufe0f <strong>Relaxing gameplay</strong> \u2013 Enjoy stress-free progression and creative freedom</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're crafting a charming corner shop or building a bustling organic marketplace, <i>Sproutmart</i> invites you to grow, decorate, and thrive in your own cozy retail dream.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859130?t=1760010865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/69508eaf08344180e6b413d64f3bbb9c168fc411/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760010865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/dcd9402693b1222aaa1f4c2abad9b9db6a77d807/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760010865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/dcd9402693b1222aaa1f4c2abad9b9db6a77d807/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760010865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Welcome to Sproutmart!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sproutmart</i> is a relaxing, cozy shop management simulation where you build, customize, and run your very own grocery store. Grow fresh produce in your backyard farm, decorate every corner of your shop, and serve your customers with love \u2014 all at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Build &amp; expand your grocery shop</strong> \u2013 Design layouts, upgrade shelves, and stock up on homegrown goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3d <strong>Backyard farming</strong> \u2013 Plant, grow, and harvest fruits and vegetables right behind your shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize your space</strong> \u2013 Decorate with style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Multiplayer co-op</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends online to grow, manage, and decorate your store together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing</strong> \u2013 Catch fish and add fresh seafood to your product lineup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfa <strong>Sell what you grow</strong> \u2013 Harvest your crops, fill your displays, and keep your customers happy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2601\ufe0f <strong>Relaxing gameplay</strong> \u2013 Enjoy stress-free progression and creative freedom</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're crafting a charming corner shop or building a bustling organic marketplace, <i>Sproutmart</i> invites you to grow, decorate, and thrive in your own cozy retail dream.</p>","developers":["Kappa Bits Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/639588d9e95d563e2ff4c56f84e744e3ddac89aa/header.jpg?t=1760010865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859130/253432279/9fbc01d7e142409f9d2e23cd7ea95f9587e965af/1760009164/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760010848","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859130/253432279/9fbc01d7e142409f9d2e23cd7ea95f9587e965af/1760009164/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760010848","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859130/253432279/9fbc01d7e142409f9d2e23cd7ea95f9587e965af/1760009164/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760010848","id":257214785,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214785/movie480.mp4?t=1760010848","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214785/movie_max.mp4?t=1760010848"},"name":"Sproutmart - EA Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214785/db3c539f9e05805096adb5a49fb1f48863fbac2d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760010848","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214785/movie480.webm?t=1760010848","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257214785/movie_max.webm?t=1760010848"}}],"name